---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageIntro from "@/components/global/PageIntro.astro";
import OfferLadder from "@/components/global/OfferLadder.astro";
import Wrapper from "@/components/fundations/containers/Wrapper.astro";
import ContactBand from "@/components/global/ContactBand.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="Practical AI Services for Small Businesses" pageDescription="Assess the opportunity, improve one valuable workflow, or build AI capability over time with Danny Sullivan in Raleigh.">
  <PageIntro eyebrow="Ways to work together" title="You bring the business problem. I’ll help choose the right level of solution." description="Most work begins with an assessment. From there, the right answer may be a clearer process, a reusable ChatGPT workflow, ordinary automation, a custom GPT, or focused software." ctaHref="/ai-opportunity-assessment/" ctaLabel="Start with the assessment" />
  <OfferLadder surface="soft" />

  <section id="focused-improvement" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-[var(--brand-paper)]">
    <Wrapper variant="wide" class="py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5"><p class="field-label">02 · Focused AI improvement</p><h2 class="font-editorial mt-5 text-5xl leading-[.98]">One workflow. One baseline. One result worth judging.</h2><p class="font-utility mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--brand-orange)]">$2,000 one-time</p><a href="/contact/?service=focused" class="site-cta mt-8">Improve one workflow →</a></div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <p class="text-base leading-7 text-base-600">We begin with what happens today, what it costs, and what must remain under human control. Then we build the smallest improvement capable of proving its value.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-[var(--brand-orange)] pl-5"><p class="field-label">The fit test</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6">Before building, we look for a credible path to recovering at least 5–10 hours a month or protecting several thousand dollars in annual value. If the baseline does not support the investment, this is not the right project.</p></div>
          <div class="mt-8 grid gap-px border border-black/10 bg-black/10 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="bg-[var(--brand-paper)] p-6"><p class="field-label">Possible solution</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-600"><li>Reusable ChatGPT workflow</li><li>Custom GPT or knowledge system</li><li>Process redesign</li><li>Simple automation</li><li>Focused software</li></ul></div>
            <div class="bg-[var(--brand-paper)] p-6"><p class="field-label">What you keep</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-6 text-base-600"><li>Improved workflow</li><li>Review and failure rules</li><li>Team walkthrough</li><li>Documentation</li><li>Success measure</li></ul></div>
          </div>
          <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-base-500">The $2,000 fee covers one clearly scoped workflow. An AI Opportunity Assessment may be recommended first and is priced separately.</p>
          <p class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-[var(--brand-orange)] pl-5 text-sm font-semibold leading-6">ChatGPT is often the most familiar place to begin. I stay tool-independent so the business problem—not the platform—decides the solution.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>

  <section id="ongoing-partner" class="scroll-mt-6 bg-[var(--brand-forest)] text-[var(--brand-paper)]">
    <Wrapper variant="wide" class="py-16 sm:py-24">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
        <div class="lg:col-span-5"><p class="field-label text-white/50">03 · Ongoing AI partner</p><h2 class="font-editorial mt-5 text-5xl leading-[.98]">Build capability without hiring a full-time AI leader.</h2><p class="font-utility mt-6 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-[var(--brand-orange)]">$2,000–$5,000 per month</p><a href="/contact/?service=partner" class="site-cta mt-8">Explore a partnership →</a></div>
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <p class="text-base leading-7 text-white/65">Most small businesses are not short on AI ideas. They are short on time, ownership, and a dependable way to turn experiments into operating improvements.</p>
          <div class="mt-6 border-l-2 border-[var(--brand-orange)] pl-5"><p class="field-label text-white/50">The fit test</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-white">This is for businesses with multiple recurring opportunities whose combined conservative value is comfortably above the monthly fee—typically through recovered capacity, faster revenue, or fewer costly delays.</p></div>
          <ol class="mt-8 border-t border-white/15">
            <li class="grid gap-3 border-b border-white/15 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr]"><span class="field-label text-[var(--brand-orange)]">01</span><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-white/65"><strong class="text-white">Prioritize:</strong> maintain a backlog of opportunities ranked by business value and readiness.</p></li>
            <li class="grid gap-3 border-b border-white/15 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr]"><span class="field-label text-[var(--brand-orange)]">02</span><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-white/65"><strong class="text-white">Improve:</strong> work through one valuable bottleneck at a time instead of launching a broad transformation.</p></li>
            <li class="grid gap-3 border-b border-white/15 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr]"><span class="field-label text-[var(--brand-orange)]">03</span><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-white/65"><strong class="text-white">Teach:</strong> turn useful ChatGPT workflows and systems into shared team capability.</p></li>
            <li class="grid gap-3 border-b border-white/15 py-5 sm:grid-cols-[3rem_1fr]"><span class="field-label text-[var(--brand-orange)]">04</span><p class="text-sm leading-6 text-white/65"><strong class="text-white">Measure:</strong> compare each improvement against the baseline and expand only when it earns a place.</p></li>
          </ol>
          <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-white/50">Monthly scope depends on the number of workflows, team involvement, implementation complexity, and support required.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-[var(--brand-surface-soft)]">
    <Wrapper variant="wide" class="py-14 sm:py-20">
      <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16"><div class="lg:col-span-4"><p class="field-label">How work is scoped</p><h2 class="font-editorial mt-5 text-4xl leading-[.98] sm:text-5xl">Value first. Hours second.</h2></div><div class="lg:col-span-8"><p class="max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-base-600">The prices are visible. The decision to proceed still depends on the economics of your problem—not the hours it takes me to deliver the work.</p><div class="mt-7 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><p class="border border-black/10 bg-[var(--brand-paper)] p-5 text-sm leading-6"><strong class="block">First establish the baseline</strong><span class="text-base-600">Frequency × time × people, plus delays, quality, capacity, and revenue exposure.</span></p><p class="border border-black/10 bg-[var(--brand-paper)] p-5 text-sm leading-6"><strong class="block">Then make the go/no-go decision</strong><span class="text-base-600">If the conservative expected value does not clearly exceed the investment, we do not build.</span></p></div><p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-5 text-base-500">Time and dollar figures are qualification targets based on your baseline, not guaranteed savings or revenue.</p></div></div>
    </Wrapper>
  </section>

  <ContactBand eyebrow="Still deciding?" title="You do not need to diagnose the solution before we talk." description="Tell me what is taking too much time or creating delays. I’ll help identify the right starting point." ctaHref="/contact/?service=unsure" ctaLabel="Tell me what’s stuck" />
</BaseLayout>
